{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1129237-what-would-your-character-do-m-tas-ed","id":1129237,"title":"What would your character do? (M: TAS ed)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-15T08:12:55-07:00","id":1129237,"title":"What would your character do? (M: TAS ed)","content":"These WWYCD games I came up with were some-what popular on the Werewolf forums so I decided to do one on mage. The rules are simple, I provide a scenario and you have to tell me what your character would do.<br /> <br /> \u200b#1 You and your cabal have been tracking a courier service under the payroll of the Technocracy. After hacking their delivery logs, you discover they are about to deliver a payroll to a gang of smugglers hired by the Syndicate to smuggle less then legal goods across international waters. You decided to intercept the courier before he delivers the money. This, of course, will have to be done without alerting the technocracy, who probably have someone or something watching the courier to make sure he dose not run off with the money. What does your character do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T09:34:19-07:00","id":1129269,"title":"","content":"If we are making this completely freeform and paradigm-free....<br /> <br /> <br /> ...I use Correspondence, Forces and Matter to judge the weight of the cash, and then use Correspondence and Matter to place-swap the money for something of equal weight and roughly the same volume.<br /> <br /> Nyuk nyuk nyuk.<br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> I am trying to think of a second scenario, but quite frankly, without any general constraints presented for the thread (or at least constraints per scenario),<br /> <br /> It's hard to think of something that isn't easily solved by simply going &quot;I use Sphere X, Y and Z.&quot; Yep. The scenarios need constraints in sphere levels, Arete, Quintessence, Sanctum, Countermeasures and/or Sleepers present.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 08-15-2017, 03:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T15:23:16-07:00","id":1129454,"title":"","content":"Try and fail to convincingly convince this Cabal that he's not beaming everything he sees directly to technocratic servers for later analysis. Then end up in an argument with his erstwhile comrades, fistfighting one. We carry on as usual after this. My character never realizing that these people are actually deviants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T17:30:32-07:00","id":1129495,"title":"","content":"Tip off the police, I got greater mysteries to solve then being a superhero","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T18:07:38-07:00","id":1129522,"title":"","content":"Alright, I have a new rule. You have to answer the question in the way your current or old PC would solve it. Along with their spheres and everything else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T18:24:14-07:00","id":1129536,"title":"","content":"That is exactly how my last character would solve the problem. By reporting everything back to his technocratic superiors, get into a stupid fistfight with one of the cabalmates, ruining the whole mission.<br /> <br /> And then they would all go off to go do something else. Mixed Technocracy/Tradition groups get weird.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T18:44:19-07:00","id":1129546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1129237-what-would-your-character-do-m-tas-ed?p=1129522#post1129522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright, I have a new rule. You have to answer the question in the way your current or old PC would solve it. Along with their spheres and everything else.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI would use Forces (3) to pick up my phone, dial the police by hand and leave an anonymous tip as to do the smuggler situation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T18:56:09-07:00","id":1129552,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BurritoMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1129237-what-would-your-character-do-m-tas-ed?p=1129546#post1129546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bI would use Forces (3) to pick up my phone, dial the police by hand and leave an anonymous tip as to do the smuggler situation.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see what you did there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T21:01:50-07:00","id":1129639,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1129237-what-would-your-character-do-m-tas-ed?p=1129522#post1129522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright, I have a new rule. You have to answer the question in the way your current or old PC would solve it. Along with their spheres and everything else.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a good (and needed) rule!<br /> <br /> Alright, let's see...<br /> She would get to the receiving smuggler first (High streetwise and already hanging in bad parts of town helps with this), observe him for a while, take him out (Nonlethally, preferrably but not necessarily. Life does wonders for making people fall asleep.), and impersonate him through shapeshifting - taking the money when the courier arrives.<br /> <br /> Then walk away with it with the Technocracy none the wiser until it is too late.<br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> To add, the beauty of this is that the Technocracy will at some point blame the smugglers for not smuggling the goods despite getting handed the money, the smuglers will blame the Technocracy for never having delivered the money, and he guy who fell asleep will probably do the darnest of not mentioning that very fact. Until somebody actually manages to figure out what happened, she's long gone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 08-16-2017, 07:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-16T06:26:00-07:00","id":1129762,"title":"","content":"My current character it's a sort of detective with a lot of perception based effects, and Contacts within the police...So, yeah, taking the phone and tip off the police seems like a plan <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I could Mind 2 the courier's toughts and get an idea of where the smugglers are, when they're going to meet, how they look. In order to give my contacts a better tip.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-16T11:06:01-07:00","id":1129885,"title":"","content":"Here is scenario 2<br /> \u200bYou are sneaking backstage in a sports stadium in order to confront a Syndicate member who is currently watching a boxing match in the owner's booth. Suddenly, a group of Stadium security guards who happen to be sleepers see you and start running towards you. What do you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-16T14:41:13-07:00","id":1129988,"title":"","content":"Physically kick them in the face until they stop being obstacles to mankinds progress through technology using hands of death without the additional forces to make it aggravated, so it's just a truckload of bashing damage.<br /> <br /> Have backup at every entrance, and a ward around the property to prevent correspondence.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-16T16:05:56-07:00","id":1130025,"title":"","content":"[For this thread, I'll be referencing a character I'd like to run, but can't because I have no one to play Mage with. He's a Celestial Chorus mage that is a Catholic deacon, who comes from a family that manifests physical traits reminiscent to portrayals of demons. Pointed ears, prominent incisors, and black, sharp fingernails (taken as an Advantage). And he, like much of his family before him, takes seriously the idea that he is descended from demons, and must be penitent for that inborn sin, and vigilant against temptation. He is generally meek, friendly, and desirous of spreading peace and resolving injustice. Focuses on Mind, Forces, and Prime.]<br /> <br /> <br /> What to do about security guards? Act like a flustered audience member, who stumbled upon the private box after getting extremely lost. Pushes the sleepers towards believing this story using Mind 2, and try to get the nice men to help him find his seat. (Yes, he would have bought a ticket, regardless of whether he intended to watch the game. To do otherwise would be stealing. That, and to deal with this exact potential situation.) While he had the guards lead him away to get to his seat, hope that his allies managed to hide, and could use the distraction to reach the box. If they took him to his seat, he'd stay for about five minutes, then go to the restroom, go invisible with Forces, and walk back to the box.<br /> <br /> Preferably, though, he would have had a &quot;Don't Notice Me&quot; aura running using Mind in the first place, so he could pass without trouble and avoid the problem entirely.<br /> <br /> And if all else fails, use Mind to make them all fall unconscious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-17T07:54:42-07:00","id":1130263,"title":"","content":"Hrrrm.<br /> <br /> This scenario #2 is a toughie for my character. if I understand it right, the security guards notice you before you are at the Private Box. Hrm.<br /> She has no magick like Mind, that could help. Life'd be good at pumping your stats to run like hell or fight like crazy*, but the latter part is..really, really not good to keep attention away - And Life's not high enough to put all of those guards out at once harmlessy in an instant.<br /> <br /> So the best course of action would be to use Correspondence2/Life 1 to 'tag' the guards, flee, mix with the audience/crowd ASAP and let Arcane 5 do its thing.<br /> Then make her way to the Private Box, knowing well the positions of said guards as they keep searching.<br /> <br /> * She isn't able to instantly just boost stats like that anyways..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 08-17-2017, 04:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}